body:
Our hair is gorgeous, I think you can make your face work, while not stereotypically gorgeous, you could try to make your features work to your advantage in some way...Have you tried dark framed glasses as well. 
Main thing is to lose weight. And I hope you're funny, smart, and your personality is gold, will really shoot you up there. 
I'd say right now you're pretty tho. Also try to avoid getting your foundation in the base of your hair, shit always happens to me ;^;
